   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The composite has outer function F with \\( \\frac{d}{du} \\sqrt{u} = \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}} \\) and inner function \\( u = 19 - 2 x^{2} \\), whose derivative is \\( - 4 x \\).",
