      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "By the product rule and the chain rule, \\( h'(x) = - \\frac{6 x^{3}}{\\sqrt{19 - 2 x^{2}}} + 6 x \\sqrt{19 - 2 x^{2}} \\).",
