         "rule_named": "product rule with the chain rule"
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "At x = 3 the inner value is 1 and the inner derivative is -12, so \\( h'(3) = 18 + 27 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\left(-12\\right) = -144 \\).",
